- `state/core-daemon.md` — the daemon itself (plan.md). COMPLETE.
- `state/thermostat-ui.md` — thermostat UI + heating example scripts. COMPLETE.
- `state/fs-plugin.md` — Lua `fs` module, rooted log_file. COMPLETE.
